{"seq":1,"slug":"impact-on-biology","title":"对生物学的影响","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/impact-on-biology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"unifying-the-life-sciences","title":"统一生命科学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/impact-on-biology/unifying-the-life-sciences","wordCount":1738,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"evolutionary-medicine-and-ecology","title":"演化医学与生态学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/charles-darwin/influence-and-legacy/impact-on-biology/evolutionary-medicine-and-ecology","wordCount":1711,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"对生物学的影响\">对生物学的影响</h1><p>进化论对生物学的影响是奠基性的。它为这门学科提供了一个统一的解释框架，使原本零散的知识获得了共同的根基。本章考察这一影响的两个层面。</p>\n<p>第一篇文档讲述进化论如何统一生命科学——正如名言所说，&quot;若无演化之光，生物学的一切都将无从理解&quot;。第二篇文档讲述它如何催生演化医学、生态学等现代分支，至今仍在产出新知。</p>\n"}